{"version": 2, "width": 112, "height": 30, "timestamp": 1790940905, "title": "POSE: real checks pass, missing evidence blocks closeout", "command": "bash examples/demo/record.sh", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color", "SHELL": "/bin/bash"}}
[0.894704, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36mThe agent implemented the feature and reported it finished.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.895847, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36mEvery conventional check agrees.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.895871, "o", "\u001b[1m$ go test ./...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.015275, "o", "ok  \texample.com/exporter\t0.001s\r\n"]
[4.017857, "o", "\u001b[1m$ go vet ./...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.055511, "o", "\u001b[1m$ go build ./...\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.083804, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36mSo does POSE, on the checks it runs.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.083827, "o", "\u001b[1m$ pose validate --strict\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[7.183469, "o", "  -> test go test ./...\r\n  <- test pass 0.0s\r\n  -> vet go vet ./...\r\n  <- vet pass 0.0s\r\n3 step(s) \u00b7 3 pass \u00b7 0.1s\r\nResult: SUCCESS\r\n"]
[9.184543, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36mAnd yet the delivery does not close.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.184568, "o", "\u001b[1m$ pose lint-spec customer-export --strict\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.195912, "o", "\u2716 error requirement-trace customer-export\r\n    requirement trace: R1 has no trace entry (declare satisfied, waived or withdrawn)\r\nResultado: FALHA (1 spec(s) com se\u00e7\u00e3o obrigat\u00f3ria vazia/esquel\u00e9tica ou gate de ciclo de vida violado)\r\n"]
[12.19703, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36mThe code is not in question. The promise is unconnected to evidence.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.198325, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36mConnect it \u2014 or waive it, or withdraw it. Silence is not an option.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.210768, "o", "\u001b[1m$ pose lint-spec customer-export --strict\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[15.221123, "o", "spec.trace.missing=0\r\n"]
[15.221142, "o", "Resultado: SUCESSO\r\n"]
[17.222738, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;36m\"Done\" is not evidence.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
